{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 36, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL CONCERNS REGARDING THE ROLE OF INDIVIDUALS IN RELATION TO THE LEGAL SYSTEM. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE AND PROMOTES A SENSE OF MORAL RESPONSIBILITY AMONG CITIZENS. HOWEVER, ON THE OTHER HAND, IT ALSO RAISES QUESTIONS ABOUT WHO GETS TO DECIDE WHAT CONSTITUTES A \"BAD\" LAW AND WHETHER SUCH A DECISION SHOULD BE LEFT TO INDIVIDUAL INTERPRETATION.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" OVERLOOKS THE IMPORTANCE OF THE RULE OF LAW IN MAINTAINING SOCIAL ORDER AND STABILITY. IF INDIVIDUALS WERE TO SELECTIVELY FOLLOW LAWS BASED ON THEIR PERSONAL OPINIONS, IT COULD LEAD TO CHAOS AND UNDERMINE THE AUTHORITY OF THE LEGAL SYSTEM. INSTEAD, IT IS GENERALLY MORE EFFECTIVE TO WORK WITHIN THE EXISTING LEGAL FRAMEWORK TO BRING ABOUT CHANGE AND REFORM, RATHER THAN ENCOURAGING INDIVIDUALS TO TAKE THE LAW INTO THEIR OWN HANDS. THIS APPROACH ALLOWS FOR A MORE ORGANIZED AND PEACEFUL PROCESS OF CHALLENGING AND REFORMING LAWS THAT ARE DEEMED UNJUST OR INEQUITABLE.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -4.565611743601039e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -9.894321920000948e-06}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.00062851223628968}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.14402322471141815}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0008061258122324944}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -1.597391747054644e-05}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " BAD", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"t